        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#7A8490;margin:0 0 20px;">Tell us what's going on. We call back fast during business hours.</p>
        <form id="contact-form" novalidate style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New estimate request — greeleysolarreset.com">
